msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Today, we released Quarkus 3.2.8.Final, the eighth maintenance release of "
"the 3.2 LTS release train."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release fixes the following CVE:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-5720[CVE-2023-5720] build env "
"information disclosure via gradle plugin"
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using a 3.2 release."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are not already using a 3.2 release, please refer to https://github."
"com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[our migration guide]."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.2.8."
"Final[the full changelog of 3.2.8.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... "
"Let's build something great together!"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our "
"welcoming community:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https:/"
"/groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/"
"quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr ""
